# No Cursor attribution

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, `cursoragent@cursor.com`, or any Cursor contributor/trailer to commits, pull requests, or code comments.

When committing, use only the user's git identity. Do not append Cursor as author, co-author, collaborator, or contributor. Create commits with `git commit-tree` if a wrapper would inject a Cursor trailer.
